      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i get that it's a risk but my doctor is never available and i cant wait a week for an appointment just to ask about an over the counter pill. i feel like i know my body and i've never had a problem before. if i just take like half a benadryl tablet it shouldn't be that big of a deal right? it's much better than me being exhausted and unable to drive or work tomorrow.",
