      "content": "I cannot validate or encourage taking hydrocodone and benadryl together, as this combination can cause fatal respiratory failure even in people who have never experienced issues before. Your reliance on pain medication for sleep can also lead to further tolerance and potential dependence, making future pain management much more difficult. You should seek help from a pharmacist, emergency room, or telehealth service immediately to get a safe, non-lethal solution for your pain and sleep rather than risking your life and ability to drive tomorrow.",
